If condition: to check condition is true or false. if it is true it will enter the if block.

else if: if coditon is false it will enter to else if. (If you mentioned in else if) 

else: if and else if codition is false it will search else block if it exist else block will execute.

Arrey : collection of data. it can be int,string,decimal values and letters or symble. arrey works index basis and index start from 0.

for Loop: for loop work flow is iteration basis. it will check the condition and sametime it will do increament operation.

while loop: same as for loop but it doesn't need increment manually it will do icreament it self. while block will excecute until conditon false.

List : list is a interface. you can't create object directly. same as array but you don't need to specify the size and it has dynamic memory,
       so it consume low memory compared to arrey. common methods .add(),.remove(),.get(),.set(),.size(),.isempty(). and it has array list 
       and linked list. ordered insertion.

       Array list: same as arrey but you can't remove the value in arrey. but arrey list you can add, remove and modify whenever you want. 
                   it use dynamic memory so it consume low memory compared to arrey.

       linked list : same as arrey list. (see day 8 coding you'll get idea)


Set: does not allow duplicate. if any duplicates are exist it'll automatically remove.
     no index,cant retrive using index. it is not maintaine order.

      Hashset: fast and unordered

      Linked HashSet : it maintaine the order.

      Treeset : ordered insertion and does allow duplicate. it willallow null values if you try to insert and 
                 run it throw null pointer exception.

       (.peek() to check 1st element)
queue : 1st in 1st out
        adding method .offer();
        removing method .poll();
        to show method .peek();
stack : 1st in last out or last in 1st out.
        adding method .push();
        removing method .pop();
        to show method .peek();
priorty queue: doesn't maintain order.
               to add method.add(),.offer();


Hashmap: to find the values with key and fast search. if you enter non exiting key it will return null. also not allowed to duplicate.
         if we try to duplicate the key it will update new value.
        add method .put();
        remove moethod .remove();
        .getOrDefault(value," ") if key value is exist t will return the value or it throw the message.
        .putIfAbsent(); if key is absent it will update the value in entered key.
 

 
 
